{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ability",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 135,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 165,
      "text": "## 技能实体\n\nhas-ability · 完整 abilityUniqueName\n同 ID 的内嵌 / 独立技能可汇合\nability-links.mjs · 强化与移植证据",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "part",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 165,
      "text": "## 组件实体\n\nhas-component / requires\n成员关系与配方消耗分别保留\ncount / slot / source 伴随关系",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "item",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 430,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 统一实体 · items/*.json\n\n完整 /Lotus/... 或 wf:<kind>/<id>\nname / description 按语言存\nrelations.json 连接各实体",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "manifest",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 135,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 165,
      "text": "## Oracle · JobManifest.json\n\nrewards = 完整奖励表路径\nbounty-references.json 保留引用\n清单引用不等于当前轮次确认",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "table",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## Plus · ExportRewards.json\n\n表路径 → 池数组 → type / itemCount\nreward-tables.json 保留全部表和池\nprobability 无值时不从 rarity 猜",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "recipe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 蓝图与配方 · recipes.json\n\n蓝图 --produces→ 成品\n蓝图 --requires→ 材料 × 数量\nresultType 是成品身份依据",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "art",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 825,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 175,
      "text": "## 共享图像描述与文件\n\nimages.json / service.mjs 描述符\n蓝图底纹 + recipe.resultId 成品图\nLocalImages 读取共享图库，不复制",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "live",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 实时奖励是另一道判断\n\noracle-rewards.mjs\n候选表 ∩ 有效世界状态奖励表\n仅唯一命中才确认当前表",
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
